# ::tok For example , attorney Anna Reif Lignza from the law firm " Kaspi Sror & Co . " specializes in representing victims of medical negligence , explains that her firm handled a case of a child who was injured during his birth when the midwife ruptured the amniotic sac while the baby 's head was too high . This led to umbilical cord prolapse ( where the umbilical cord precedes the baby 's head during birth ) , resulting in compromised oxygen supply to the baby 's brain ( due to pressure on the cord ) , and as a result , the child was born with severe neurological damage .
